.DS_Store
# Diagnostic OHLCV caches (~40MB, reproducible via test/backtest/fetch-data.mjs; exact fetch
# ranges recorded in the diagnostic report). The four legacy BTCUSDT-<tf>.json fixtures the
# sanity gates depend on predate this pattern and stay committed.
test/backtest/data/ohlcv-*.json
# Funding-rate history caches for the carry study — same reproducibility contract
# (test/backtest/fetch-data.mjs --funding; ranges recorded in research/studies/carry-study-*.md).
test/backtest/data/funding-*.json
# Fear & Greed index cache (alternative.me, free/no-key) for the non-price sweep — same
# reproducibility contract (test/backtest/fetch-fng.mjs; range recorded in research studies).
test/backtest/data/fng.json
# Non-price channel caches (Wikipedia pageviews, Deribit DVOL, GDELT tone/volume) for the
# 2026-07-27 channel study — same reproducibility contract (test/backtest/fetch-nonprice.mjs
# <wiki|dvol|gdelt>; window and per-asset coverage recorded in
# research/studies/nonprice-channels-2026-07-27.md).
test/backtest/data/nonprice-*.json
# Edge-tournament public-data caches (scripts/fetch-edge-tournament-data.mjs; manifest in cache/).
test/backtest/edge-tournament/cache/
# Local pg_dump snapshots (scripts/db-backup.sh) — operational artifacts, never committed.
backups/
# Y3 collector / Y2 sweep runtime output (scripts/loop-collect.mjs is the single writer; the
# durable git record is research/loop/LOG.md + state.md). Machine-written evidence artifacts,
# never committed — tracking them would force per-tick commits or a permanently dirty tree.
research/loop/digests/
# Offline eval corpus dumps (reproducible via scripts/dump-eval-corpus.mjs against the recorded
# agent_decisions source — see that script's provenance note).
test/eval/agentic/data/*.jsonl
# Ephemeral research dumps (row logs, unpromoted tournament JSON). Promoted scorecards live in
# research/scorecards/ and are tracked deliberately.
research/candidates/**
!research/candidates/.gitkeep
